# Dataset JSON is LF on every platform (RFC #45 phase 1). Without this, a
# Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true checks files out as CRLF, and the
# repository itself had drifted to a mix: 19 files stored CRLF, three
# files mixed within the file. scripts/format-data.ts checks bytes
# exactly, which only works when every checkout agrees on line endings.
*.json text eol=lf
